{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reclaimed. Remade. Reclayed. The Legendary Platypus Returns!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22 years after its first appearance, the iconic indie shoot \u2018em up Platypus is coming back, better than ever! Led by the original creator Anthony Flack, alongside the talented Claymatic team, we're embarking on a journey to bring the beloved classic into the present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platypus Reclayed isn't just a simple remaster\u2014it's a complete revamp. Reprogrammed from scratch and updated for modern hardware, with all-new models and artwork photographed in 4k widescreen, featuring updated gameplay, new weapons and additional content. Get ready to dive into the heart-pounding action of this fast, frantic, and incredibly fun arcade-style shoot-em-up! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/7381e846a0a70e427da97dbd6a8daf23.poster.avif?t=1766066628\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/7381e846a0a70e427da97dbd6a8daf23.webm?t=1766066628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/7381e846a0a70e427da97dbd6a8daf23.mp4?t=1766066628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Colossatropolis: A City in Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The once-thriving metropolis of Colossatropolis is now bursting at the seams. Towering skyscrapers dominate the skyline, while pollution chokes the air - and parking is a nightmare. Desperate times call for desperate measures, and Colossatropolis sets its sights on neighbouring Mungola for expansion. But little do they know, Mungola isn't going down without a fight...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/9102311652991fbdb15f7b8708b9d30d.poster.avif?t=1766066628\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/9102311652991fbdb15f7b8708b9d30d.webm?t=1766066628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/9102311652991fbdb15f7b8708b9d30d.mp4?t=1766066628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Legendary F-27 &quot;Platypus&quot; Takes Flight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the heart of Mungola, a single squadron of fighter planes stands as the last line of defence\u2014the legendary F-27 &quot;Platypus&quot;. Despite their age, these antique aircraft are the Mungolan people's last hope for freedom. Are you ready to pilot the Platypus and take on the mighty Colossatropolan battle fleet?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/9b5bb571617e9089f15ef418c9ee2b28.poster.avif?t=1766066628\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/9b5bb571617e9089f15ef418c9ee2b28.webm?t=1766066628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/9b5bb571617e9089f15ef418c9ee2b28.mp4?t=1766066628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The original handmade shooter!</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/a0147dcb827fdd0a66c7046ab96fbc1b.poster.avif?t=1766066628\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/a0147dcb827fdd0a66c7046ab96fbc1b.webm?t=1766066628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/a0147dcb827fdd0a66c7046ab96fbc1b.mp4?t=1766066628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>Features That Will Keep You Coming Back for More</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two-Player Simultaneous Action: Team up with a friend for double the fun! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning Claymation Graphics: Experience the beauty of claymation like never before with all-new high definition artwork.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addictive, Exciting Gameplay: Get ready for heart-pounding action that will keep you on the edge of your seat. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original Platypus soundtrack is back with even more officially licensed remixes of classic 1980s game tunes from our friends at C64audio. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable Difficulty Settings: Whether you're a novice or a seasoned pro, Platypus has a challenge for everyone. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for the Entire Family: Share the joy of Platypus with loved ones of all ages!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/1423c7dafac902218bdf50ebbd279e88.poster.avif?t=1766066628\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/1423c7dafac902218bdf50ebbd279e88.webm?t=1766066628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/1423c7dafac902218bdf50ebbd279e88.mp4?t=1766066628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Claymatic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a small indie studio with a love for stop-motion animation. We have a passion for straightforward, honest games with uncomplicated and effective mechanics that deliver fun gameplay and can be played over and over without ever feeling old. Our community means everything to us; we play, bounce ideas and chat very openly about everything we do and work on. We are firm believers in open development and transparency.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"PEACENIK","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2912430/19cb36b2bb77aaf1d8de89f3cf2045c8d4a1069b.jpg"},{"name":"PERFECTION","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2912430/7184f6462163afb7de7f2e96ed84ffc5c0994224.jpg"},{"name":"WRECKING CREW","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2912430/bbd9af344e65e27cb356459e20c59c9b5c51c5de.jpg"},{"name":"PRECISION PILOT","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2912430/b8c37781c56ea88b4143e3e34b6950c455b6e537.jpg"},{"name":"CONVOY RAIDER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2912430/e5940fb4aa9c415feb449ddabd7065c6024257fb.jpg"},{"name":"LIGHTNING FIGHTER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2912430/9f3d1b834b86a6cea34031b93bcda3cb67ed5949.jpg"},{"name":"HEAVYWEIGHT CHAMP","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2912430/e4d48d64d71ceec6ca5d59c057c232cf3fcd9da9.jpg"},{"name":"FOOD FIGHT","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2912430/7db8e0f919351641ba7923a76a5c01651b981699.jpg"},{"name":"REBEL STAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2912430/186173f4f204322a5d055951927e1133232dade4.jpg"},{"name":"CASTLE CRASHER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2912430/87189a9e644478053bfc68a55e927fb00010a6d4.jpg"}],"total":28},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2912430?t=1766066628","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766066628","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/a8534ce778e649d41d524457db6a6da9d414c319/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766066628","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/a8534ce778e649d41d524457db6a6da9d414c319/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766066628","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3780370,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reclaimed. Remade. Reclayed. The Legendary Platypus Returns!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22 years after its first appearance, the iconic indie shoot \u2018em up Platypus is coming back, better than ever! Led by the original creator Anthony Flack, alongside the talented Claymatic team, we're embarking on a journey to bring the beloved classic into the present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platypus Reclayed isn't just a simple remaster\u2014it's a complete revamp. Reprogrammed from scratch and updated for modern hardware, with all-new models and artwork photographed in 4k widescreen, featuring updated gameplay, new weapons and additional content. Get ready to dive into the heart-pounding action of this fast, frantic, and incredibly fun arcade-style shoot-em-up! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/7381e846a0a70e427da97dbd6a8daf23.poster.avif?t=1766066628\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/7381e846a0a70e427da97dbd6a8daf23.webm?t=1766066628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/7381e846a0a70e427da97dbd6a8daf23.mp4?t=1766066628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Colossatropolis: A City in Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The once-thriving metropolis of Colossatropolis is now bursting at the seams. Towering skyscrapers dominate the skyline, while pollution chokes the air - and parking is a nightmare. Desperate times call for desperate measures, and Colossatropolis sets its sights on neighbouring Mungola for expansion. But little do they know, Mungola isn't going down without a fight...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/9102311652991fbdb15f7b8708b9d30d.poster.avif?t=1766066628\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/9102311652991fbdb15f7b8708b9d30d.webm?t=1766066628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/9102311652991fbdb15f7b8708b9d30d.mp4?t=1766066628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Legendary F-27 &quot;Platypus&quot; Takes Flight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the heart of Mungola, a single squadron of fighter planes stands as the last line of defence\u2014the legendary F-27 &quot;Platypus&quot;. Despite their age, these antique aircraft are the Mungolan people's last hope for freedom. Are you ready to pilot the Platypus and take on the mighty Colossatropolan battle fleet?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/9b5bb571617e9089f15ef418c9ee2b28.poster.avif?t=1766066628\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/9b5bb571617e9089f15ef418c9ee2b28.webm?t=1766066628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/9b5bb571617e9089f15ef418c9ee2b28.mp4?t=1766066628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The original handmade shooter!</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/a0147dcb827fdd0a66c7046ab96fbc1b.poster.avif?t=1766066628\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/a0147dcb827fdd0a66c7046ab96fbc1b.webm?t=1766066628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/a0147dcb827fdd0a66c7046ab96fbc1b.mp4?t=1766066628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>Features That Will Keep You Coming Back for More</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two-Player Simultaneous Action: Team up with a friend for double the fun! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning Claymation Graphics: Experience the beauty of claymation like never before with all-new high definition artwork.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addictive, Exciting Gameplay: Get ready for heart-pounding action that will keep you on the edge of your seat. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original Platypus soundtrack is back with even more officially licensed remixes of classic 1980s game tunes from our friends at C64audio. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable Difficulty Settings: Whether you're a novice or a seasoned pro, Platypus has a challenge for everyone. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for the Entire Family: Share the joy of Platypus with loved ones of all ages!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/1423c7dafac902218bdf50ebbd279e88.poster.avif?t=1766066628\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/1423c7dafac902218bdf50ebbd279e88.webm?t=1766066628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/extras/1423c7dafac902218bdf50ebbd279e88.mp4?t=1766066628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Claymatic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a small indie studio with a love for stop-motion animation. We have a passion for straightforward, honest games with uncomplicated and effective mechanics that deliver fun gameplay and can be played over and over without ever feeling old. Our community means everything to us; we play, bounce ideas and chat very openly about everything we do and work on. We are firm believers in open development and transparency.</p>","developers":["Claymatic Games"],"dlc":[4194510,4014150,4025750,4025970],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912430/dcb7e5a0a9221025db1a04929493f0986b3cf27e/header.jpg?t=1766066628","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2024 Claymatic Games Ltd. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13+</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2912430/1119335218/bc8bb0396da9d82e704a7c46c1ca5a5caabe2746/1758139861/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758178598","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2912430/1119335218/bc8bb0396da9d82e704a7c46c1ca5a5caabe2746/1758139861/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758178598","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2912430/1119335218/bc8bb0396da9d82e704a7c46c1ca5a5caabe2746/1758139861/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758178598","id":257200395,"name":"Platypus Reclayed Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257200395/60c76ed638a6d48e28f5b67ca84b10f478b3ed13/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758178598"}],"name":"Platypus Reclayed","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_licens